  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、&lt;Mint&gt;様、
おかえりなさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my, it's Lady &lt;Mint&gt;.
We welcome you back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ただいま戻りました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それで、今日の
相談事は何ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, what did you
want to discuss today?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...U-Um...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あはは……すいません、
&lt;Mint&gt;様がいない間、私たちで
代わりができないかと思って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahaha... Sorry. Since you've been
gone, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;, we've been
trying to fill in for your absence.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、やっぱり難しいですね。
私たちは&lt;Mint&gt;様ほどの癒し系
ではありませんし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, it certainly is difficult.
We're never quite as
therapeutic as you, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それに、その胸はね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And of course, we
can't match her chest.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>not sure if it should be "her" or "your". would need to check ingame - dragon</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、それは関係ないのでは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I'm not sure that's relevant...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277252</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ともかく、&lt;Mint&gt;様ひとりに
法術師させておくのも
大変だと思って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, we also thought it
was a lot of work for you to
be our only cleric, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、私たちも法術の
勉強を始めたんですよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mhm. So we've been studying
the clerical artes ourselves.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、法術はそう簡単には……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, clerical artes
are rather difficult to...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わかっています。
ですから、少しずつ
修行を積んで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We understand. That's why
we've been practicing them
a little bit at a time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まず、村のみんなの相談に
乗れるようにここで
&lt;Mint&gt;様の代わりをしながら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For now, we've been practicing
them while speaking to the people
of the village in Lady &lt;Mint&gt;'s place.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277684</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mint&gt;様のお帰りを
待ってますよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've been waiting for
your return, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、ですか……
ありがとうございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I see... Thank you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『癒しの家』シスターズって
呼んでください♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please call us the Nuns of
the "House of Healing"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え！？　『癒しの家』！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh!? The House of Healing!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ど、どうしたんです！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What's wrong!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>い、いえ……
なんでもない……です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, no... There's...
nothing wrong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278076</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『癒しの家』って……
&lt;Mint&gt;さんが作った
法術師の結社の名前……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The "House of Healing"...
That's the name of the society
of clerics &lt;Mint&gt; created.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、ぼくたち、
歴史の１ページに
立ち会えたってことだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then I guess we're witnessing
history in the making.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y-Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの、いつもなら、
もっとはしゃぐのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong? You'd usually be
a lot more excited about that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だ、だって、あんま興奮して
ちょっと心臓がばくばくって
いうか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-It's, uh, I'm kind of too excited...
It's like my heart's going to
pound out of my chest...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That much...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;の基準って
よくわかんないね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your standards are
pretty weird, &lt;Dio&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それと&lt;Mint&gt;様、実は
これ、旅の法術師の方から
譲っていただいたのですが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Also, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;, I wanted to tell you...
A travelling cleric left this to us...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これはロッド……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is...a rod...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>法術師を目指してるって
話したら
譲っていただいたのですが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After we told her we were
hoping to become clerics,
she left it with us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とても強い力が
宿っていて、とても
私たちの力では手に負えません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's a great power resting
within it. At our level, it would be
impossible for us to use it properly.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>旅の方が……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A traveller...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ、カイさんと
おっしゃってましたけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, she introduced
herself as Kai...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カイさん……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kai...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ、白い法衣を着た
清楚な感じの女性でしたけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. She was a very tidy
woman in white robes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……確かに……
とても強い力を感じます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A great power...
Yes, I sense it, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぜひ、&lt;Mint&gt;様の旅に
お役立てください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Without a doubt, it will be of
help on your travels, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいのですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you sure?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ、私たちでは、
とてもとても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, for us, it's far too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、ありがたく
使わせてもらいます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, I will use it with gratitude.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mint&gt;様が
戻ってこられるまでに
私たちも一人前になります</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By the time you return,
Lady &lt;Mint&gt;, we will be
qualified clerics, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mint&gt;様のお仕事を
支えられますように……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We will do our best to assist
you in your work, Lady &lt;Mint&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとうございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
